>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `FCP_ss`

``` hol4
fcpLib.FCP_ss : ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

A simpset fragment for simplifying finite Cartesian product expressions.

### Example

``` hol4
  simpLib.SSFRAG{name = NONE, ac = [], congs = [], convs = [],
                 dprocs = [], filter = NONE,
                 rewrs =
                   [(NONE, |- !i. i < dimindex (:'b) ==>
                                  ($FCP g ' i = g i)),
                    (NONE, |- !g. (FCP i. g ' i) = g),
                    (NONE, |- !x y. (x = y) =
                      !i. i < dimindex (:'b) ==> (x ' i = y ' i))]}
   : ssfrag
```

